<title>GREECE: Table of Greek mutual fund flows, assets.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek mutual fund flows, assets.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian BanK reported the following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices.</p>
<p>					Dec 24/Dec 23    Dec 24/Dec 31,95</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.07		12.45</p>
