<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   1.12		64.55</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.06	     -20.16</p>
<p>  Growth funds			   -0.35	     -11.59</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31, 1991. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
